{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_2.json|/dataList/16/desc","kr_sha":"e6fc38994ef2eed4ab76591352781977d0aa8f414959b8f94bac0d7c7b670602","zh":"- 總結下來……\n可以說是將各種可能性都以絲線的形態編織成紡錘狀……的東西。\n坦白地說，由於我幾乎是原封不動地寫下了浮士德所說的話，所以這也算不上是什麼總結。我並不明白她的話究竟是什麼意思……\n它給我一種類似於撥動自己的錶盤時那滿眼星空的感覺。就好似敬畏之情一般。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_2.json|/dataList/16/id","kr_sha":"281831d914166c90f7540b78274ba77919246f5a8801eee9cd873d6455b0a195","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_41","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_2.json|/dataList/16/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_2.json|/dataList/17/desc","kr_sha":"2146ce7de00a319d7d34da28af37f8d9d0c9ddd9022a691efe4db391c7f0d7ae","zh":"- 當罪人們靠近這東西時，他們似乎會產生與頭暈類似的異常感覺。\n這種現象也被稱為「共鳴」，這可能與引發我頭痛的原理相似。\n- 每當金枝回收完畢，維吉里烏斯便會通知其他部門的人員對其進行處理。\n當我問到這件事時，他只會說「將會呈遞給本部」。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_2.json|/dataList/17/id","kr_sha":"a07b8a61962e3478d267d0fec04b06ba9da5f471a927ca38d399a60d7c7bf577","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_42","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
